    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "28 Belarmine Vale is a beautifully presented two-bedroom own door apartment, ideally positioned within the highly regarded Belarmine development in Stepaside. Built by the renowned Castlethorn, this spacious and light filled home offers stylish accommodation in a mature and exceptionally convenient setting.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises an entrance hall with stairs leading to the main living area, a spacious hallway with excellent storage, two generous double bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en suite shower room, and a contemporary family bathroom. The heart of the home is the open plan kitchen, dining and living area, which enjoys direct access to a private balcony, creating an ideal space for both everyday living and entertaining. Ample resident and visitor parking is available to the front.\r\n\r\nBelarmine is a vibrant and established community with an excellent range of amenities on the doorstep, including a supermarket, pharmacy, medical centre, fitness studio, cafés, playground and a variety of local services. The nearby village of Stepaside offers an additional selection of shops, restaurants and cafés, while larger retail and commercial hubs such as Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Business District, Beacon South Quarter and Leopardstown are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly well served by an excellent choice of schools, both primary and secondary, including Our Lady of the Wayside National School, Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille, Kilternan Church of Ireland National School, Stepaside Educate Together and Rosemont School.\r\n\r\nOutdoor enthusiasts are exceptionally well catered for, with the Dublin Mountains offering extensive hill walking and mountain biking trails nearby. Local sporting amenities include Kilternan Tennis Club, De La Salle Palmerston Rugby Club, Wayside Celtic Football Club and the beautiful Fernhill Park and Gardens, comprising approximately 80 acres of landscaped parkland.\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent, with easy access to the Luas Green Line, numerous Dublin Bus routes including the 44, 47 and 118, together with the M50 and N11, providing swift connectivity to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\n28 Belarmine Vale presents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a stylish and spacious home in one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential communities, where modern convenience, excellent amenities and beautiful outdoor spaces come together to create an exceptional place to live."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance\r\nwith steps leading to: \r\n\r\nLanding\r\nFitted carpet, storage closet x 2, attic access.\r\n\r\nKitchen & Living room\r\nTimber flooring, generous range of fitted floor and wall units, Neff oven & grill, Smeg 4 gas burner, Candy washing machine, Neff dishwasher, fridge, stainless steel sink, access to the private balcony with beautiful parkland views.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 – Master\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted carpet, television point.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\r\nTiled floor, wash hand basin with shaver light, Wc, step in shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nWith fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nShower Room\r\nRecently renovated with tiled floor and walls, wc, wash hand basin with vanity unit, step in shower with chrome attachments and rain affect shower head, wall mounted mirror, towel heater."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• c.68 Sq.m / 731 Sq.ft\r\n• Beautifully presented throughout \r\n• Private balcony\r\n• 2 Bedrooms\r\n• Master bedroom ensuite\r\n• Fully renovated bathroom\r\n• G.F.C.H.\r\n• Stepaside Village\r\n• Stepaside Educate Together & Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille\r\n• LUAS (Gallops or Glencairn Stop), Dublin Bus 44, 47 & 118, N11/M50 motorways"
